    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Diffusion-Based Impedance Learning for Contact-Rich Manipulation Tasks
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Geiger%2C+N">Noah Geiger</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Asfour%2C+T">Tamim Asfour</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hogan%2C+N">Neville Hogan</a>, 
      
