        LLMs4All: A Review of Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> Across Academic Disciplines
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ye%2C+Y">Yanfang Ye</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+Z">Zheyuan Zhang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ma%2C+T">Tianyi Ma</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+Z">Zehong Wang</a>, 
      
