    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Model selection meets clinical semantics: Optimizing ICD-10-CM prediction via <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span>-as-Judge evaluation, redundancy-aware sampling, and section-aware fine-tuning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dai%2C+H">Hong-Jie Dai</a>, 
      
