        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.18711">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2509.18711">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2509.18711">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
      </p>
      <div class="tags is-inline-block">
        <span class="tag is-small is-link tooltip is-tooltip-top" data-tooltip="Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition">cs.CV</span>
        
          
