        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.18542">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2509.18542">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2509.18542">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
